  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the remaining tiles in the 28-piece set. Unlike cards, the frequency of totals is not uniform.\n\nAvoid letting the running total during pegging reach 21 if you suspect the opponent has a 10-value tile (a common total).\n\nDiscard tiles into the crib that are 'unconnected' if you are the defender, or 'high probability' (like 7s and 8s) if you are the dealer.",
